<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Nouveau message de contact</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f6f9;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;">
  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f4f6f9;padding:40px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table width="620" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">

          <!-- Header -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background:#0B1B3D;padding:32px 40px;text-align:center;">
              <h1 style="margin:0;color:#F2A900;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;">ATLANTIC ENERGY</h1>
              <p style="margin:8px 0 0;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;">Nouveau Message de Contact</p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Body -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:40px;">

              <p style="margin:0 0 24px;color:#374151;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">
                Vous avez reçu un nouveau message via le formulaire de contact du site.
              </p>

              <!-- Info Table -->
              <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:28px;">
                <tr style="background:#f8fafc;">
                  <td style="padding:14px 20px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#6b7280;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;width:140px;">Nom</td>
                  <td style="padding:14px 20px;font-size:14px;color:#111827;font-weight:600;"><%= firstName %> <%= lastName %></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:14px 20px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#6b7280;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;">Email</td>
                  <td style="padding:14px 20px;font-size:14px;color:#111827;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;"><a href="mailto:<%= email %>" style="color:#0B1B3D;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;"><%= email %></a></td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="background:#f8fafc;">
                  <td style="padding:14px 20px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#6b7280;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;">Téléphone</td>
                  <td style="padding:14px 20px;font-size:14px;color:#111827;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;"><a href="tel:<%= phone %>" style="color:#0B1B3D;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;"><%= phone %></a></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:14px 20px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#6b7280;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;">Sujet</td>
                  <td style="padding:14px 20px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;">
                    <span style="display:inline-block;background:#F2A900;color:#0B1B3D;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;"><%= subject %></span>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- Message -->
              <p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#6b7280;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;">Message</p>
              <div style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;padding:20px 24px;">
                <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#374151;line-height:1.8;white-space:pre-wrap;"><%= message %></p>
              </div>

              <!-- CTA -->
              <div style="margin-top:32px;text-align:center;">
                <a href="mailto:<%= email %>" style="display:inline-block;background:#0B1B3D;color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0.5px;">
                  Répondre à <%= firstName %>
                </a>
              </div>

            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background:#f8fafc;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;">
              <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;">
                Ce message a été envoyé depuis le formulaire de contact d'<strong>Atlantic Energy</strong> &mdash; <%= YEAR %>
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
